  "bio": "Tucked away in the heart of Ormskirk, Fox & Dagger is a bespoke tattoo studio that specializes in captivating floral, neotraditional, and traditional tattoos. This private sanctuary of artistry offers an intimate space for creativity without the bustle of a traditional walk-in shop, focusing solely on crafting exquisite inkwork with the talents of @steeltat13, @aimeebrayart, @lydiatattoos, @inkinsomnia_tattoo, and the promising apprentice @daylefoggart.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Ormskirk, England, United Kingdom\n\nPrivate Studio, Ormskirk *We don't do piercings*\n@steeltattooer @aimeebrayart @inkinsomnia_tattoo and Junior artist @daylefoggart",
